Depends: hifiberry-webui (>= 0.28), hifiberry-auth, hifiberry-audiocontrol (>= 0.25), nginx, python3, cage, cog, wlr-randr, curl, udev, nftables, polkitd, unattended-upgrades
Description: audio-os appliance: touch web UI, device helper and system configuration
 Web UI served by nginx at /, the loopback device helper behind /api/device/,
 the panel kiosk (cage + cog), touch-timeout, the inbound firewall and the
 appliance hardening drop-ins for a HiFiBerry-based Raspberry Pi player.
